      "created_at": "2016-04-01T00:48:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Deadline was in the second preview - the week after Dok’Thorath.</p>\n<p>They have not previewed Enclave, Kaargra or Progeny.</p>\n<p>Enclave will be previewed in next week’s livestream.</p>\n<p>The fact that they previewed both Cap Cosmic and Infinitor together in this week’s livestream suggests to me that they are getting closer to release <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
