      "id": 170092,
      "name": "Kratos13",
      "username": "Kratos13",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/65b543/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-04-01T12:53:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Some fun numbers:</p><p>The first preview of Mini-Pack 1 was 90 days after Sentinels Digital was first released.</p><p>Mini-Pack 1 was released 23 days after the first preview.</p><p>The first preview of Rook City was 19 days after Mini-Pack 1 was released.</p><p>Rook City was released 49 days&nbsp;<span>after the first preview</span>.</p><p>The first preview of Infernal Relics was 21 days after Rook City was released.</p><p>Infernal Relilcs was released 62 days&nbsp;<span>after the first preview</span>.</p><p>The first preview of Mini-Pack 2 was 102 days after Infernal Relics was released.</p><p>Mini-Pack 2 was released 35 days&nbsp;<span>after the first preview</span>.</p><p>The first preview of Shattered Timelines was 25 days after Mini-Pack 2 was released.</p><p>Shattered Timelines was released 43 days&nbsp;<span>after the first preview</span>&nbsp;(8 days after the Listening Party).</p><p>The first preview of Wrath of the Cosmos was 41 days after Shattered Timelines was released.</p><p>The listening party for Wrath of the Cosmos is 28 days&nbsp;<span>after the first preview</span>.</p>",
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:52:30.266Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
