      "raw": "<p>Some fun numbers:</p><p>The first preview of Mini-Pack 1 was 90 days after Sentinels Digital was first released.</p><p>Mini-Pack 1 was released 23 days after the first preview.</p><p>The first preview of Rook City was 19 days after Mini-Pack 1 was released.</p><p>Rook City was released 49 days&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">after the first preview</span>.</p><p>The first preview of Infernal Relics was 21 days after Rook City was released.</p><p>Infernal Relilcs was released 62 days&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">after the first preview</span>.</p><p>The first preview of Mini-Pack 2 was 102 days after Infernal Relics was released.</p><p>Mini-Pack 2 was released 35 days&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">after the first preview</span>.</p><p>The first preview of Shattered Timelines was 25 days after Mini-Pack 2 was released.</p><p>Shattered Timelines was released 43 days&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">after the first preview</span>&nbsp;(8 days after the Listening Party).</p><p>The first preview of Wrath of the Cosmos was 41 days after Shattered Timelines was released.</p><p>The listening party for Wrath of the Cosmos is 28 days&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">after the first preview</span>.</p>",
